es, regression/provenance/shared-error audits, reconstruction receipt, final report, and semantic-enrichment decision packet\n- adds focused fail-closed tests for authority selection, hash drift, supersession ambiguity, global conservation, state separation, identity uniqueness, zero-call posture, and byte-identical replay\n\n## Result\n\nThe frozen union conserves exactly:\n\n- 16 authenticated batches\n- 432 complete-paper assignments\n- 3,533 terminal questions\n- 3,027 `resolver_verified`\n- 470 `verified_agreement`\n- 36 `safe_rejection`\n- 3,497 rows admitted to verified structural staging\n\nThis PR does **not** claim a fully verified corpus. The 36 safe rejections remain visible, source-bound, and outside verified staging. It performs zero new provider/VLM calls and zero semantic, KG, canonical, production, public, or downstream writes.\n\n## Validation\n\n- `python3 scripts/vlm/issue_1694_final_consolidation.py --verify-replay` — PASS; all 864 QP/MS source bytes and 432 surface authorities checked; two output trees byte-identical\n- `python3 scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1694_final_consolidation.test.py` — 10/10 PASS\n- cross-batch final-resolution/pre-provider/reconciliation regression — 101/101 PASS (Batch010 image fixture rerun in isolated Pillow 11.3.0 environment)\n- `python3 -m py_compile ...` — PASS\n- `git diff --check` — PASS\n- `npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json` — healthy governance/artifact guards; expected dirty/upstream warnings before commit/push\n- broad `npm run lint -- --no-cache` remains red on 47 pre-existing frontend errors in untouched files; no changed JavaScript/React files and no deterministic/data-integrity failure\n\n## Review gate\n\nPlease bind independent review to the exact live PR head SHA. Any deterministic code, hash, provenance, identity, conservation, replay, false-accept, or state-separation failure blocks merge; unrelated runner/frontend lint debt is nonblocking under #1649.","created_at":"2026-07-24T02:07:33Z","